  <h2>How the Estimate Works</h2>
  <h3>Real 2026 Prices</h3>
  <p>Every number behind the sliders is a price we've verified in the field: guesthouse beds at 80-120 RMB, beer fish dinners at 60-100, Li River rafts at 120-250 per raft. Move the sliders to match how you actually travel.</p>
  <h3>What's Included — and What Isn't</h3>
  <p>The estimate covers hotels, meals, local transport, and activities inside the Guilin-Yangshuo region. International flights, China visas, and gear like eSIMs and VPN subscriptions are separate — our <a href="/guilin-yangshuo-trip-cost/">full cost guide</a> breaks those down too.</p>

  <h2>Where the Money Actually Goes</h2>
  <p>In this region, accommodation and activities dominate the bill; food is startlingly cheap and good. Cutting hotel grade one notch frees enough for the private driver day or the climbing lesson — the choices people rarely regret.</p>

